{"code":"el-GR","name":"Greek","native":"Ελληνικά","badge":"ΕΛ","tts":"el-GR","about":"Greek uses “;” as its question mark.","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Δεν καταλαβαίνω.","say":"then ka-ta-la-VE-no","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Δεν ξέρω.","say":"then KSE-ro","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Μια στιγμή, παρακαλώ.","say":"mya stig-MEE, pa-ra-ka-LO","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Μπορείτε να το επαναλάβετε;","say":"bo-REE-te na to e-pa-na-LA-ve-te","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Πιο αργά, παρακαλώ.","say":"pyo ar-GA, pa-ra-ka-LO","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Πώς λέγεται «…» στα ελληνικά;","say":"pos LE-ye-te … sta e-lee-nee-KA","en":"How do you say “…” in Greek?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Βεβαίως.","say":"ve-VE-os","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Ακριβώς.","say":"a-kree-VOS","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Νομίζω πως ναι.","say":"no-MEE-zo pos ne","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Αλήθεια;","say":"a-LEE-thya","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Κανένα πρόβλημα.","say":"ka-NE-na PROV-lee-ma","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Τέλεια!","say":"TE-lya","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Πού είναι {x};","say":"poo EE-ne {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Θα ήθελα {x:acc}.","say":"tha EE-the-la {x:acc}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Έχετε {x:acc};","say":"E-che-te {x:acc}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x:acc}, παρακαλώ.","say":"{x:acc}, pa-ra-ka-LO","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Πρέπει να {x}.","say":"PRE-pee na {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Μπορώ να {x};","say":"bo-RO na {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Θα το ελέγξω.","say":"tha to e-LENK-so","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Έχω σύσκεψη.","say":"E-cho SEE-skep-see","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Είναι καυτερό;","say":"EE-ne kaf-te-RO","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Χωρίς κρεμμύδι, παρακαλώ.","say":"cho-REES kre-MEE-dee, pa-ra-ka-LO","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Τι μου προτείνετε;","say":"tee moo pro-TEE-ne-te","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Δεν τρώω κρέας.","say":"then TRO-o KRE-as","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Πόσο κάνει;","say":"PO-so KA-nee","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Απλώς κοιτάζω.","say":"ap-LOS kee-TA-zo","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Θα το πάρω.","say":"tha to PA-ro","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Μπορώ να πληρώσω με κάρτα;","say":"bo-RO na plee-RO-so me KAR-ta","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Είναι μακριά;","say":"EE-ne ma-kree-A","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Στο αεροδρόμιο, παρακαλώ.","say":"sto a-e-ro-DRO-mee-o, pa-ra-ka-LO","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"αριστερά · δεξιά · ευθεία","say":"a-ree-ste-RA · dek-see-A · ef-THEE-a","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Βοήθεια!","say":"vo-EE-thya","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Δεν έχει χαρτί υγείας.","say":"then E-chee char-TEE ee-YEE-as","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Δεν αισθάνομαι καλά.","say":"then es-THA-no-me ka-LA","en":"I don’t feel well.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Καλέστε ασθενοφόρο, παρακαλώ.","say":"ka-LE-ste as-the-no-FO-ro","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Χάρηκα.","say":"CHA-ree-ka","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Από πού είστε;","say":"a-PO poo EE-ste","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Τι δουλειά κάνετε;","say":"tee doo-LYA KA-ne-te","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Είναι πεντανόστιμο!","say":"EE-ne pen-da-NO-stee-mo","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Γεια σας.","say":"ya sas","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Καλημέρα.","say":"ka-lee-ME-ra","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Τι κάνετε;","say":"tee KA-ne-te","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Ναι. · Όχι.","say":"ne · O-chee","en":"Yes. · No.","hook":"Careful: ναι (ne) means YES."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Παρακαλώ.","say":"pa-ra-ka-LO","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Ευχαριστώ.","say":"ef-cha-ree-STO","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Συγγνώμη.","say":"seeg-NO-mee","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Αντίο.","say":"an-DEE-o","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"ένα · δύο · τρία","say":"E-na · DEE-o · TREE-a","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"τέσσερα · πέντε · έξι","say":"TE-se-ra · PEN-de · EK-si","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"επτά · οκτώ · εννέα","say":"ep-TA · ok-TO · e-NE-a","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"δέκα · είκοσι · εκατό","say":"DE-ka · EE-ko-see · e-ka-TO","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Το μήλο είναι κόκκινο.","say":"to MEE-lo EE-ne KO-kee-no","en":"The apple is red.","note":"το = the (neuter) · the adjective agrees"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Τρώω το μήλο.","say":"TRO-o to MEE-lo","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"-ω = I, so no “εγώ” needed"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Έφαγα το μήλο.","say":"E-fa-ga to MEE-lo","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past often changes the stem: τρώω → έφαγα"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Θέλω να φάω το μήλο.","say":"THE-lo na FA-o to MEE-lo","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"θέλω να + verb = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Τρως μήλα;","say":"tros MEE-la","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"the voice goes up · ; is the question mark"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"η τουαλέτα","say":"ee too-a-LE-ta","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"το φαρμακείο","say":"to far-ma-KEE-o","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"το νοσοκομείο","say":"to no-so-ko-MEE-o","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"ο σταθμός","say":"o stath-MOS","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"το αεροδρόμιο","say":"to a-e-ro-DRO-mee-o","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"το ξενοδοχείο","say":"to kse-no-do-CHEE-o","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"νερό","say":"ne-RO","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"ένας καφές","say":"E-nas ka-FES","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink","acc":"έναν καφέ","accSay":"E-nan ka-FE"},{"id":"bill","t":"ο λογαριασμός","say":"o lo-gar-ya-ZMOS","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt","acc":"τον λογαριασμό","accSay":"ton lo-gar-ya-ZMO"},{"id":"menu","t":"ο κατάλογος","say":"o ka-TA-lo-gos","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order","acc":"τον κατάλογο","accSay":"ton ka-TA-lo-go"},{"id":"beer","t":"μια μπίρα","say":"mya BEE-ra","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"αυτό","say":"af-TO","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"μια σακούλα","say":"mya sa-KOO-la","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"η σύσκεψη","say":"ee SEE-skep-see","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"το αρχείο","say":"to ar-CHEE-o","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"η οθόνη","say":"ee o-THO-nee","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"το μήνυμα","say":"to MEE-nee-ma","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"αύριο","say":"AV-ree-o","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"φύγω","say":"FEE-go","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"μπω","say":"bo","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"πληρώσω","say":"plee-RO-so","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Αλλεργία · παρακαλώ διαβάστε","ask":"Έχει αυτό το πιάτο κάποιο από αυτά τα υλικά;","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Ευχαριστώ πολύ!","note":"Peanut is “αράπικα φιστίκια”; plain “φιστίκια” can mean pistachios.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Έχω σοβαρή αλλεργία στα αράπικα φιστίκια. Δεν μπορώ να φάω αράπικα φιστίκια ούτε φυστικέλαιο.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Έχω σοβαρή αλλεργία στα θαλασσινά (γαρίδες, καβούρια, μύδια).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Δεν μπορώ να φάω γλουτένη (σιτάρι, κριθάρι, σίκαλη).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Δεν τρώω κρέας, κοτόπουλο ούτε ψάρι.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Δεν τρώω χοιρινό.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"ΤΟΥΑΛΕΤΕΣ · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"ΓΥΝΑΙΚΩΝ · ΑΝΔΡΩΝ","en":"Women · Men"},{"t":"ΕΞΟΔΟΣ · ΕΙΣΟΔΟΣ","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"ΩΘΗΣΑΤΕ · ΕΛΞΑΤΕ","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"ΕΞΟΔΟΣ ΚΙΝΔΥΝΟΥ","en":"Emergency exit"}]}